{"results":[{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/bhoomi-group/bhoomi-sagar-manthan-138106","title":"Bhoomi Sagar Manthan, Kandivali West, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK Luxury Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 226718](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/Project%20Image/1-1742365298.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 226719](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/Project%20Image/2-1742365298.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 226723](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/Amenities/225_1678021157_gloria-grand--project-brief-6-1742365435.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Location of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 226724](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/Location/Artwork-Bhoomi--Sagar-Manthan-(1)-10-1742365441.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n36 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.19 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 22 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nSagar Manthan is a thoughtfully designed residential project that redefines modern living with its blend of luxury and convenience. From the moment you step into its grand double-height entrance lobby, the project exudes sophistication. High-speed branded elevators provide seamless access, while the interiors are crafted with meticulous attention to detail—featuring gypsum-finished walls and ceilings, premium paint, and vitrified flooring that enhances the elegance of every room and passage. A beautifully designed terrace garden offers a peaceful retreat, while an exclusive fitness center ensures residents can maintain a healthy and active lifestyle.  \n  \nOffering spacious 2 and 3 BHK apartments, Sagar Manthan is designed to cater to the needs of urban dwellers seeking comfort and refinement. Each unit is thoughtfully planned to maximize space, natural light, and ventilation, ensuring a harmonious living environment. The seamless blend of high-quality construction and modern aesthetics makes it an ideal choice for homeowners who appreciate fine living.  \n  \nStrategically located in a thriving neighborhood, Sagar Manthan provides unmatched connectivity to essential services and lifestyle hubs. Residents enjoy easy access to hospitals, banks, business parks, malls, gardens, schools, and colleges, making everyday life effortless and convenient. With its prime location and premium offerings, Sagar Manthan is more than just a home—it’s a statement of refined living.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 834336](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/BHK_Configuration/2-BHK-615-CA-1742365270.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n615 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.54 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 834337](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/BHK_Configuration/2-BHK-694-CA-1742365279.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n694 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.72 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 834338](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138106/BHK_Configuration/3-BHK-822-CA-1742365287.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n822 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.55 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Bhoomi Sagar Manthan in Kandivali West, 