r at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549872894065-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549874989954-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549877240464-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bedroom in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549879608786-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549881833452-010426034308438.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Living Room in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549884183410-010426034308438.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Builder Floor for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Builder Floor for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2127169, 72.838776](/assets/images/loc-icon.svg)\n\n**₹ 1.49 Cr**\n\nThis semi-furnished 845 square feet builder floor within the Highland Harmony project in Kandivali West, Mumbai, presents a blend of comfort and accessibility.Situated on the ground floor, this 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom residence is ideal for those who value ease of entry and movement, enhanced further by the inclusion of two dedicated parking spaces.Constructed between 2 to 4 years ago, the property\n\nPersonalized home recommendations based on your lifestyle, location, and budget.\n\n![Smarter home match recommendation preview](/assets/images/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n